Rumors about Apple's first foldable iPhone are picking up now that the device has entered <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/06/iphone-fold-trial-production/">a new testing stage</a> that precedes mass production. If you've been having trouble keeping up with what's new, we've recapped the latest <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-fold/">iPhone Fold</a> rumors that have come out over the last few weeks.<br/>
<br/>
